      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm! Seems to me that VRChat might've unintentionally moved them off of the \"Player\" layer in the game, which is the sorting layer in VRChat that defines both the Local and Remote Player.\nI think it's definitely important to move the controllers and trackers back to the \"Player\" layer, as that is an important layer required for Mirrors to render players in the first place, no matter if it's a High-Quality or a Transparent Mirror.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
